                <div class="moiss-val-card">
                    <div class="moiss-val-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-gem"></i></div>
                    <h3 class="moiss-val-title">Craftsmanship Standards</h3>
                    <p class="moiss-val-desc">To deliver maximum brilliance across various carat weights, our master diamond cutters meticulously examine and cut every individual lab-grown diamond and moissanite stone. By blending traditional lapidary artistry with modern precision, we maximize each gem's internal light performance, ensuring your jewelry radiates incomparable fire and sparkle.</p>
                </div>

